S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8PSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\tau]^{\\leq\\omega}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\tau)\">\\([\\tau]^{\\leq\\omega}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\tau)\\)</span> (countable-family class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}p\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8PSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\in[\\tau]^{\\leq\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal U\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal U\\in\\tau\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}p\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8PSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\in[\\tau]^{\\leq\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal U\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal U\\in\\tau\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nonempty countable intersections are required to be open. The empty intersection is the ambient carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, already open by the topology predicate; it is not represented by the unrelativized set intersection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcap\\varnothing\">\\(\\bigcap\\varnothing\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-s